UID:omsi-20261106T180000-godzilla-minus-zero-2026@small-screens-pdx
DTSTAMP:20261104T202843Z
DTSTART:20261107T020000Z
DTEND:20261107T041500Z
SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero (2026)
LOCATION:OMSI Empirical Theatre\, 1945 SE Water Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5083;-122.6672
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Takashi Yamazaki · 135 min\n\nSpecial showing: Opening Ni
 ght Event\n\nWar reduced Japan to zero\, and Godzilla plunged it into minu
 s. Two years have passed since then\, and the country has faced agonizing 
 struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as 
 humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace\, a new threat strikes\, cru
 shing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\n\
 nTickets: https://tickets.omsi.edu/events/01a10e54-be73-855b-4b0a-2364ffd5
 adbb\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://tickets.omsi.edu/events/01a10e54-be73-855b-4b0a-2364ffd5adbb
END:VEVENT
